## Architecture
```
[ Web UI + Map ]  ->  [ API Server ]  ->  [ NYC Open Data ]
                            |
                     [ Risk Engine ]
                       |         |
              [ Rules: precedent   [ LLM: roast +
                tag matching ]       explanation ]
```
 
| Layer | Tech |
|---|---|
| Front end | React or Next.js, MapLibre or Leaflet |
| Back end | Python (FastAPI) or Node |
| Risk engine | Rules decide the risks; LLM only phrases them, so output stays grounded |
| Voice (stretch) | ElevenLabs or browser speech API |
 
## Roast Layer
- Roasts target the plan, never the person
- Every roast has a serious line below it: the risk, the precedent, and who must act
- Intensity dial: **Mentor**, **Senior Examiner**, **DOB at 4:59 pm on Friday**
- Life safety items (for example, excavation next to unreinforced masonry) default to serious tone first, roast second
